---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="A little about Christina and why MS Playbook exists."
	pubDate={new Date('August 25 2026')}
>
	<p>
		I'm Christina. A while back, MS became part of my life, and I've spent a lot of time since
		then figuring out how to talk about it — to doctors, to family, to friends, and honestly, to
		myself. This blog is where I'm putting that into words.
	</p>

	<p>
		<strong>MS Playbook</strong> isn't a medical resource, and I'm not a doctor. It's a personal record
		of what this journey actually looks like: the appointments, the adjustments, the days that go
		sideways, and the days that go better than expected. I'm writing it for me, first — to process
		things and keep track of what I've learned — and I'm publishing it in case any of it is useful
		to someone else walking a similar path.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'll write about whatever feels relevant at the time — symptoms and how I'm managing them,
		mindset, small wins, setbacks, things I wish someone had told me earlier. It won't always be
		tidy, and it won't always be upbeat. That's kind of the point.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you're here because you or someone you love is dealing with MS, I'm glad you found this.
		Feel free to follow along on the <a href="/blog">blog</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
